  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{通|とお}す→通す：02300_toosu⟧ (transitive, to let through). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{通|とお}る (pass through X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing or completed action. {通|とお}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is passing' or 'has passed.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{通|とお}る (go along a road)\n- ⟦{門|もん}→門：14603_mon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{通|とお}る (pass through a gate)\n- ⟦{試験|しけん}→試験：01422_shiken⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{通|とお}る (pass an exam)\n- ⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{通|とお}る (voice carries well)\n- ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{通|とお}る (message gets through)\n- ⟦{通|とお}り→通り：01475_toori⟧ (street—noun; also: way, manner)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {通|とお}る (intransitive): pass through\n- ⟦{通|とお}す→通す：02300_toosu⟧ (transitive): let through, pass (something)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{通|かよ}う→通う：01217_kayou⟧: to commute (repeated passing)",
